  "content": "\n\n<h1><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\"> </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\">\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/View on-GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上查看\"></a></p></h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n    \n# 礦脈採礦機\n\n當你蹲下並用鎬挖掘礦石時，它會自動採集相連的整個礦脈。\n\n![1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/64ad1935bc25e006be50ed8fa4d9697da2639985.gif) \n![2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/1e1388588ccb36007b8137ce4584200f31626d17.gif)\n\n## 運作方式\n- 蹲下（潛行）並使用鎬挖掘任何礦石方塊。整個相連的礦脈將被自動挖掘（**兼容絲綢之觸**）\n\n## 注意事項\n- 偵測到附魔為**幸運**時，會自動停用礦脈挖掘功能",
